# Synthetic fixture: require_grid sets skip_test, which turns every subsequent
# `expect` into a SKIP and DROPS every other verb -- accept, tolerance,
# direction and, notably, roundtrip, which is discarded rather than skipped.
# The cascade ends at the next `operation`.
<gie-strict>
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
operation     fake shift=0
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
require_grid  no_such_grid_exists.gsb
accept        1 2
expect        1 2
tolerance     100 m
roundtrip     5
expect        999 999
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
operation     fake shift=0
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
accept        1 2
expect        1 2
</gie-strict>
